close_reason: "Time-bounded waivers now raise a scheduled notice before they can block a release, and the expired and soon-expiring waivers were re-decided"
contract_change:
  api: "evaluateBoundaryFixtures, evaluateDefectGateEvidence and their report types"
  before: Reports said nothing about an approaching expiry; a waiver stayed silent until it expired and failed the gate
  after: "Reports carry waiver_notices for valid live waivers inside the declared waiver_notice_days window, and ok is unchanged"
  migrate: "Code that constructs BoundaryFixtureReport or DefectGateEvidenceReport adds waiver_notices: []; declare waiver_notice_days in the policy or registry to receive notices"
